  "details": "On Desktop mode, clicking on an option, toggle or different page on the Action Menu will sometimes have a random chance to mark an input on the starting press of a left click, which is not meant to happen.\n\nThis will then mark the release of left click as a second input and will click twice. \n\nThis is a very annoying bug because you might click to enter a different page on your Action Menu, just for the menu to then input a second toggle by accident.",
